# Or-patterns in match cases

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A content integer
  -- B content integer
  -- C content (integer, money)
  -- D content (money, integer)
  -- F
  -- G

#[test]
declaration scope S:
  internal values content list of E
  output no_binding content list of integer
  output shared_binding content list of integer
  output swapped_binding content list of integer
  output with_wildcard content list of integer
```

```catala
scope S:
  definition values equals
    [A content 1; B content 2; C content (3, $4); D content ($5, 6); F; G]

  definition no_binding equals
    map each v among values to
      match v with pattern
      -- A or B: 1
      -- C or D: 2
      -- F or G: 3

  definition shared_binding equals
    map each v among values to
      match v with pattern
      -- A content x or B content x: x
      -- C or D or F: 0
      -- G: 100

  definition swapped_binding equals
    map each v among values to
      match v with pattern
      -- C content (x, y) or D content (y, x): x * 10 + integer of y
      -- A content x or B content x: x
      -- F or G: 0

  definition with_wildcard equals
    map each v among values to
      match v with pattern
      -- A content x or B content x: x
      -- anything: 0
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[RESULT]─ S ─
│ no_binding = [
│                1;
│                1;
│                2;
│                2;
│                3;
│                3;
│              ]
│ shared_binding = [
│                    1;
│                    2;
│                    0;
│                    0;
│                    0;
│                    100;
│                  ]
│ swapped_binding = [
│                     1;
│                     2;
│                     34;
│                     65;
│                     0;
│                     0;
│                   ]
│ with_wildcard = [
│                   1;
│                   2;
│                   0;
│                   0;
│                   0;
│                   0;
│                 ]
└─
```
